(text "PERFBOARD (70 x 50): screw terminals J1 (19 V in), J3 (motor), J6 (buck); pin headers J4 (ESP32), J5 (Hall) with Dupont housings." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c409269e-2f51-47ed-ad7d-aa92df56b4dc"))
(text "Heavy wire (20-22 AWG): 19 V, GND, motor. C1 sits right at U1's VS and the GND next to it; C2 (optional) at J1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b98181e0-43ce-42c9-a097-36b8b17d407f"))
(text "U1 MS1 = MS2 = 3V3: 1/16 microstepping. CLK, TX, RX and DIAG unconnected. Set Vref ~0.7 V before connecting the motor." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3afe2c6b-3fc7-44a7-98ca-69d2ed35b551"))
(text "R2 (optional) holds EN high (motor off) while the ESP32 boots." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a85a2ae-ba7e-48a0-80e6-d96e3410bccb"))
(text "Motor M1: 6-pin socket, pins 1+3 = coil A (red, blue) -> A1, A2; pins 4+6 = coil B (green, black) -> B1, B2; pins 2, 5 (centre taps) unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "680d8f8e-f29a-4fd2-8bdd-b839a692eb16"))
(text "U3 (base ESP32-S3) is powered by its USB cable from the Jetson - never also from the buck's 5 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 273.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7737dc08-f0a5-4776-a949-e37f1434df4d"))
(text "Hall U4 (A3144) on the motor bracket's pad: VCC from the 5 V buck, OUT pulled up to 3V3 by R1 (never to 5 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fabf8493-a292-49ad-819d-0065d02e4e29"))
(embedded_fonts no))
